---
import SectionLabel from "./SectionLabel.astro";
---

<section class="section" id="ai-workflow">
  <div class="shell narrow-copy" data-reveal>
    <SectionLabel label="AI In The Workflow" />
    <h2>AI speeds up the build. Judgment still owns the result.</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
      CodeVault uses AI where it helps: planning, debugging, refactoring, documentation,
      repetitive implementation, and review. But architecture, product decisions, security,
      user experience, and final quality control stay human.
    </p>
    <p class="strong-line">
      The goal is not AI decoration. The goal is useful software shipped with less waste.
    </p>
    <a class="button button-dark" href="#final-cta">Book a 30-minute build call →</a>
  </div>
</section>
